# good: a Jr 3 V lamp on the Jr battery holder, through the Beginner's slide switch and wires.
kits scb20, sc100
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B1 at A1 dir=right level=1
step 3: S1 at C1 dir=down level=1
step 4: L1 at D3 dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at A1 dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at D1 dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at C3 dir=up level=2
expect S1=on: L1 on
